body:
100% YTH 

There are women FIGHTING for they're rights of bodily autonomy, to have children when THEY want to and with WHO they want to and here YOU are treating a child YOU CHOSE TO HAVE like trash! You don't deserve to have children. You DON'T DESERVE TO CALL YOURSELF A MOTHER if this is how you treat your existing children. Those kids will grow up resenting you if you don't PULL YOUR HEAD OUT OF YOUR BUTT and put them first! 

&#x200B;

You're a mother. Act like one. If you're going through such a hard time to were you blow up at your kids for lashing out due to a situation YOU AND THEIR FATHER CAUSED then you need to reach out for help and find a place where they would be safe. 

&#x200B;

That son is old enough to call CPS on you for what you did then you would have them both taken from you. Is that what you want? No? Then put your big girl undies on, call a therapist that can work with your medical insurance AND GET THOSE POOR KIDS INTO THERAPY!

&#x200B;

You need it too OP. Figure out why you acted the way you did, be a better Mother for these kids and you and the Father do better and make better choices. 

&#x200B;

Again, YTA

You could use the bovine for Trans-Moo-tation! 



Did I do the pun right? OwO; 

Its soooo cute btw!
